#. y1:english="\nHi.{PA:20}||My name is {PA:10}Xin Mei.\nThanks for choosing me.{PA:20}\nYeah.\nWhat would you like to drink?\nXin Mei, {PA:10}I have to ask you something...\nHuh? {PA:20}What is it?\nDo you have a||\"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\"?\nWhy... {PA:20}What do you want with that?\nThere is someone I have to see{PA:20}||and {PA:10}I don't have much time left.\nAlright, {PA:20}but {PA:10}you have to do me a favour{PA:10}||before I give it to you.\nWhat's that?\nWell... I'm {PA:10}an illegal alien.\nI {PA:10}almost got caught by the police{PA:10}||the other day...\nIf I don't do something,{PA:10}||I'll be deported for sure.\nIf I go back to China, {PA:10}my brother...{PA:20}||he'll be all alone.\nYour brother's {PA:20}in Japan, too?\n...Yes.{PA:20}\nHe's my father and his Japanese||mistress' love child...\nHe's {PA:10}living with me right now.\nI see...{PA:20}||So, {PA:10}you're taking care of him.\nKazuma-san...{PA:20}\nDo you know about the||\"{CC:ffc8c8}Counterfeiter{CR:00}\"?\n\"Counterfeiter\"?\nA guy who can forge documents.\nPaintings, money, {PA:10}passports,||all of it...\nNobody knows his true identity.||He's only known as the \"Counterfeiter\".\nAny difference from the other||forgers around here?\nYes...{PA:20} This counterfeiter can||create {PA:10}high quality documents.\nAbsolutely untraceable.\nSounds pretty good.\nIf I leave this place,{PA:10}||I'll get caught by the police...\nKazuma-san, {PA:10}please help me!\nI want you to meet {PA:10}the \"Counterfeiter\",||and ask him to make me a passport.\nPlease, go see the {PA:10}\"{CC:ffc8c8}Counterfeiter{CR:00}\"||for me?\nOkay.{PA:20}||I have some business with him too.\nThank you {PA:10}very much!||I{PA:10} really {PA:10}appriciate it!\nSo,{PA:10} where can I find him?\nGo to a bar called {MS:0}\"Jewel\"{PA:10}||on Shichifuku St.{PA:20}\nA girl who works there, Ayaka,{PA:10}||is the contact.\nOkay.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0080.BIN:1_0_14
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0080.BIN::line:1_0_14"
msgid "Si no hago algo,{PA:10}||acabarán deportándome, seguro."
msgstr ""

