#. y1:english="Kazuma-san!\nHere you go.\nYou gave the \"{CC:ffc8c8}fake passport{CR:00}\".\nThank you! {PA:10}Thank you!{PA:10}\nNow I can stay||and take care of my brother...\nOkay, now the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\".\n......\n...What's wrong?\n...I'm sorry,{PA:10} Kazuma-san.{PA:20}||The truth is, {PA:20}I gave it to someone else.\nWhat?\nI didn't mean to trick you!{PA:20}||You gotta believe me!{PA:20}\n.........{PA:20}||?!{PA:20} Who did you give it to?\nA guy named Masutatsu Mizuno...{PA:20}\nWe used to live together{PA:10}||for a little while.\nHe was always so kind to me...{PA:20}||I gave him the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\"\nas a token of my gratitude.\nHowever... {PA:20}if you mention me,{PA:10}||I'm sure he'll give it to you.\nI'm pretty sure {PA:20}he's at the information||centre called \"{CC:ffc8c8}MEB{CR:00}\" on Shichifuku St.\nThis is for helping me out.{PA:20}||I hope it will be useful.\nYou received a \"High-Class Necklace\".\n\nThank you... {PA:10}Kazuma-san.{PA:20}||Good bye.{PA:20}\n"
